    "header": "<header class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4"><div class="grid gap-1"><h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">שאלון וואטסאפ</h1><p class="text-sm text-gray-700">גרסה 3 עונה לפניות חדשות בוואטסאפ.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500" aria-live="polite">עורכים טיוטה. השינויים נשמרים אוטומטית ולא מגיעים ללקוחות עד הפרסום.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/play.svg&quot;); -webkit-mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/play.svg&quot;); mask-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center; -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-size: contain; -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-type: alpha;"></div><span>בדיקת השאלון</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-4 " style="mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/clock-rotate-left.svg&quot;); -webkit-mask-image: url(&quot;https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/clock-rotate-left.svg&quot;); mask-repeat: no-repeat; -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center; -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-size: contain; -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-type: alpha;"></div><span>היסטוריית גרסאות</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-10 px-4 gap-3" type="button"><span>פרסום</span></button></div></header>",
  },
}
